      "review_reason": "Continuous LAZ at six months fits HeightForAgeZScore. Source explicitly mixes WHO reference for term infants and INTERGROWTH-21st for preterm infants. Preserve that distinction and low-birthweight cohort context. This is a group level without a comparator; never classify its negative z-score as a decrease. The twelve-month description contains a conflicting underweight interpretation and is left unsupported. Isolated coordinator correction retains ChildGrowth and adds WHO-supported Stunting measurement applicability. Direction remains scoped to HAZ/LAZ, never inferred as the direction of stunting prevalence.",
